{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-observable-subcategory","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:observable-subcategory","kind":"definition","title":"Observable subcategory $\\mathrm{Bun}^{\\circ}(\\mathbb{P}(V))$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-bundle-category","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-jet-horizon","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-observation"],"tags":["observable-subcategory","bundle-category","degree-zero","frobenius-pairing"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ObservableSubcategory","text":"observable-subcategory.md","leanSource":"observable-subcategory.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:observable-subcategory\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Bun}(\\mathbb{P}(V))</code> be the category of finite bundles over the projective line, whose morphisms are permutation-isotopy pairs. The <strong>observable subcategory</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Bun}^{\\circ}(\\mathbb{P}(V))</code> is the full subcategory on the objects whose degree-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code> algebra is non-trivial:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{Bun}^{\\circ}(\\mathbb{P}(V)) = \\bigl\\{ \\mathcal{S} \\in \\mathrm{Bun}(\\mathbb{P}(V)) : \\Gamma(\\mathcal{S}, A_0) \\neq 0 \\bigr\\}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/observable-subcategory.md","heading":"Definition","number":"22.12.10","page":"b/def-observable-subcategory","qa":{"counts":{"pass":80,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":64},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.ObservableSubcategory","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/observable-subcategory.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
